ckgroundColor=none;rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="n61" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="2.38" y="0.00" width="44.05" height="44.05" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n70" value="Function creation uses supplied images; code builds/pushes remain external.&lt;br&gt;No target-service creation, caller auth policy, DNS or automatic image binding.&lt;br&gt;Tracing and result-destination delivery still need runtime verification." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="40.00" y="600.00" width="850.00" height="100.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n71" value="DEFAULT RESULT: No resources; all creation/enable flags false, function/event/API-route maps empty and IAM statements empty. Seven declarations.&lt;br&gt;Created application/gateway selection requires both their enable and create flags; existing IDs are selected otherwise. No new settings are applied to existing services.&lt;br&gt;API route actions and FAAS event actions are declared invocation intent. External function IDs need not select the created Function collection.&lt;br&gt;Repository URL is an output/reference only, not the function image input." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1360.00" width="2940.00" height="160.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" value="Creation only: subnet_ids / NSGs / optional config" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;endArrow=none;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.48235294;entryY=1;entryD